{
  "scope": [
    "Thread opening positions the latest message before its first painted frame.",
    "A confirmed owner message restores following, including unpublished queued input.",
    "Assistant updates preserve a reader position higher in history."
  ],
  "implementation": [
    "useConversationScroll runs after composer/header clearance measurement and positions the library scroll state synchronously.",
    "The hook compares thread identity and owner-message publication sequence; assistant text and older pagination do not force following.",
    "Successful composer submission also invokes instant scrolling for input that remains queued outside the timeline."
  ],
